2
00:04:02,327 --> 00:04:05,997
知らぬ存じぬ 快いのかんで
Feigning ignorance with a pleasant bite,

3
00:04:05,997 --> 00:04:09,047
面倒臭さをしつけられてる
I've been disciplined to bear the annoyance.

4
00:04:09,437 --> 00:04:11,537
何から何まで
From start to finish,

5
00:04:11,537 --> 00:04:16,547
獅子お山で 効くを上手にうなづき合ってる
nodding along smoothly to whatever is asked of me.

6
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:20,737
仲良しこよしで さあ たまりたまえよ
Being buddy-buddy, come on, pile it on and hoard it!

7
00:04:21,877 --> 00:04:25,807
言えないね そんな強い言葉は
I can't say such strong words,

8
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:27,767
少しだけ静かにしてほしいね
I'd want you to quiet down a bit.

9
00:04:27,767 --> 00:04:30,827
ああ 私たち待望へ
Ah, toward our long-awaited desire...

10
00:04:31,967 --> 00:04:34,197
てくてくてく歩く ややや
Walking step by step, yeah,

11
00:04:34,197 --> 00:04:37,387
果てその日まで ねねね ねこく やややっと
until that very end, hey hey hey...

12
00:04:37,387 --> 00:04:42,547
あなたのまわりも よよよ 妖怪 せせせ 服 あれあれあれ 約束の地まで
All around you too, until the promised land!

13
00:04:43,087 --> 00:04:46,307
さあ 掲げよう ばってん ばってん てくてくてく歩く ややや
Come on, let's hold it high, marching step by step!

14
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:57,200
今日も期待 そっちのけで 家になるから
Today too, leaving expectations aside, making it my home—

15
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:00,000
私ひとりでも やってやる
even if I'm all alone, I'll make it work.

16
00:05:00,318 --> 00:05:01,318
聞きますね
You'll listen, right?

17
00:05:01,318 --> 00:05:06,678
すべてすべてすべて任せてそれをさせてよ大事なことなの分かっているでしょ
Leave everything to me, let me do it. You know it's important, right?

18
00:05:09,108 --> 00:05:15,508
白昼中怪異にの会なまんどくさいまま今日もあそぼうすぎたゆくのでしょう
In broad daylight, a strange gathering... remaining troublesome, let's play today too as time passes by.

19
00:05:36,719 --> 00:05:39,219
壁に水を上げましょう
Let's water the walls,

20
00:05:39,608 --> 00:05:43,108
時の中し折れたこと忘れてた
I forgot how time bent and broke us...

21
00:05:43,708 --> 00:05:47,008
さあだだだだ黙れ黙れ黙れ
Now, blah blah blah, shut up, shut up, shut up!

22
00:05:47,308 --> 00:05:49,808
嫌な嫌なそんな強い言葉は
Such hateful, harsh words—

23
00:05:50,008 --> 00:05:54,008
少しだけ静かにしてほしいね
I want you to quiet down just a little bit.

24
00:05:54,508 --> 00:05:58,008
私たち待望へ
Toward our long-awaited future—

25
00:05:58,208 --> 00:06:04,508
今と未来 見たかったはずなのに
Even though I should have wanted to see the present and future...

26
00:06:04,508 --> 00:06:09,508
世界点々転々ぽくやーややー見えるその日までは
Spinning round and round the world until the day it comes into view—

27
00:06:09,608 --> 00:06:14,208
どんどんどんどんえええええこの世のことはりょりょりょ
Boom boom boom, hey hey hey, the ways of this world, ryo-ryo-ryo—

28
00:06:14,208 --> 00:06:19,008
今はぜんぜんぜんぶくさっさっさあなたの方じゃなく形作るわ
Now, rot everything completely, not your side, I'll shape it myself!

29
00:06:19,108 --> 00:06:23,708
さあ世界点々転々ぽくやーややー果てすその日まで
Now, spinning round and round the world until the endless day—

30
00:06:23,708 --> 00:06:27,008
ねねねねこくやーややーあなたの周りもよよよ
Hey hey hey hey, black cat, yay yay yay, around you too, yo yo yo!

31
00:06:27,008 --> 00:06:31,008
逆回転々々ぽくやーややー白黒あれあれあい
Reverse rotation round and round, black and white, well well, love!

32
00:07:07,508 --> 00:07:11,508
今日もみんな来てくれてありがとうございます
Thank you all so much for coming today too!

33
00:07:11,508 --> 00:07:15,808
続けて歌うので盛り上がっていきましょう 声出せ！
Let's keep singing and get hyped! Make some noise!

34
00:07:16,008 --> 00:07:18,008
はい！はい！はい！はい！
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

35
00:07:24,808 --> 00:07:29,008
朽ち果てた心に i need you 朝のアルカロイド
To a decaying heart, I need you, the morning alkaloid.

36
00:07:29,308 --> 00:07:33,208
あだなはネットの晒し首 かき鳴らせ ディストーション
My nickname is net-exposed execution, strum out distortion!

37
00:07:33,508 --> 00:07:37,208
突き焼き刃の侍が乱れ打ち三弾銃
A half-baked samurai's erratic shotgun barrage,

38
00:07:37,508 --> 00:07:41,508
悲劇の歴史で踊ろうか ほら てんてこへんてこまいまい
Shall we dance in the history of tragedy? Come on, frantic and weird, spinning around!

39
00:07:42,008 --> 00:07:45,008
僕の心はエゴロック 斜め45度 ナセンス
My heart is Ego Rock, at a 45-degree angle, nonsense.

40
00:07:45,008 --> 00:07:49,008
ノウハウ砕いてマンネリを 明日に バイバイバイ
Smash the know-how, say bye-bye-bye to routine tomorrow!

41
00:07:49,308 --> 00:07:53,708
媚びへらうその姿 吐き気の空模様
That flattering posture, the sky's appearance of nausea,

42
00:07:54,008 --> 00:07:58,208
シニカルな視線の雨 今日も両目を塞ぐふり
Cynical rain of glances, pretending to cover both eyes again today.

43
00:07:59,008 --> 00:08:02,508
死にたがるな 獅子の雨 今日も両目を塞ぐふり
Don't wish to die, lion's rain, pretending to cover both eyes again today...

44
00:08:08,508 --> 00:08:13,508
もっともっと声出せるでしょ？皆さん行きますよ！
You can raise your voices even more, right? Everyone, let's go!

45
00:08:14,008 --> 00:08:15,508
はい！はい！はい！はい！
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

46
00:08:22,508 --> 00:08:26,508
おちゃらけ頭に i need you ちまたのアルカロイド
To a jokester's head, I need you, the street's alkaloid.

47
00:08:26,808 --> 00:08:30,508
あの子も流行りの インスタントショー 巻き散らしに会いに行き
That girl too, in a trendy instant show, going out to scatter it around.

48
00:08:31,008 --> 00:08:35,008
うだつが上がらぬ侍が 未来断つ哀悼歌
A struggling samurai's future-cutting elegiac song,

49
00:08:35,508 --> 00:08:39,008
無残な歴史で歌おうよ ほら ちゃんちゃらなんちゃらまいまい
Let's sing in a gruesome history, come on, ridiculous, whatever, spinning around!

50
00:08:39,508 --> 00:08:43,808
はっぴーな心で生きようか 真夏並み hot なミュージック
Shall we live with a happy heart? Midsummer-level hot music!

51
00:08:44,008 --> 00:08:48,008
端折って砕いて丸書いて 明日もわはは
Cut corners, smash it, draw a circle, laugh haha tomorrow too!

52
00:08:48,308 --> 00:08:52,508
洒落臭さも癖になる はみ出し者だろ
Even cheeky audacity becomes a habit, we're outcasts, right?

53
00:08:52,808 --> 00:08:56,508
シニカルな視線の雨 今日も両目を塞ぐふり
Cynical rain of glances, pretending to cover both eyes again today.

54
00:08:56,808 --> 00:09:03,508
リリカルな視線の雨 今日も両目を開くふり
Lyrical rain of glances, pretending to open both eyes again today.

55
00:09:11,008 --> 00:09:15,508
透明な感情は染まるだけさ
Transparent emotions are only dyed,

56
00:09:16,008 --> 00:09:19,808
だったら見て見ぬふりにする奴らを押し出せ
So push out those who turn a blind eye!

57
00:09:20,008 --> 00:09:23,808
人生かけても負けそうです 勝ち負け取り憑かれ ナセンス
Even betting my life, I might lose; possessed by winning and losing, nonsense.

58
00:09:24,008 --> 00:09:28,008
1分砕いて常識を 未来に say goodbye
Smash one minute of common sense, say goodbye to the future!

59
00:09:28,508 --> 00:09:32,508
僕の心はエゴロック 斜め45度 ナセンス
My heart is Ego Rock, at a 45-degree angle, nonsense.

60
00:09:32,808 --> 00:09:36,808
ノウハウ砕いてマンネリを 明日に バイバイバイ
Smash the know-how, say bye-bye-bye to routine tomorrow!

61
